      "content": "sometimes i look at his empty chair and i just feel so much more exhausted than i ever have in my life. it’s not just being sad. it’s this feeling that there’s nothing left for me here. everything is just grey. i feel like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. it's like i'm already gone, just walking around in a body that doesn't belong to me anymore.",
