      "content": "the thread feels like it's breaking. i don't want to hold on anymore. i just want the weight to stop. sometimes i think about him and i feel like he's just waiting for me on the other side... like the only way to really be with him again is to stop fighting this. it feels like the only way to find any peace is to just let go.",
